; possession verb (plural / infinitive form): "objects HAVE mass"
; structurally identical to "has" as a possession signal in question graphs
; have IS shashthi-vibhakti expressed as an English verb
; have = present tense, plural (or first/second person)

(bhasha verb-have
  (swarupa kriya)
  (sthita sambandha shashthi-vibhakti bahu-vachana vartamana-kaala))
